":"Today he has reached our very roots.”"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0577:b002:l038","ordinal":338920,"en":"They folded up their yurts,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0577:b002:l039","ordinal":338921,"en":"And loaded them on gray camels,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0577:b002:l040","ordinal":338922,"en":"Women wailed and maidens wept,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0577:b003:l001","ordinal":338923,"en":"As the fierce battle began."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0577:b003:l002","ordinal":338924,"en":"That precious life beloved by all,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0577:b003:l003","ordinal":338925,"en":"He valued no more than a hair,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0577:b003:l004","ordinal":338926,"en":"And left it bound by a thread."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0577:b003:l005","ordinal":338927,"en":"They stood locked in single combat,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0577:b003:l006","ordinal":338928,"en":"The earth was gouged and dust descended,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0577:b003:l007","ordinal":338929,"en":"They fought without rest for seven days,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0577:b003:l008","ordinal":338930,"en":"Until the field itself was ruined,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0577:b003:l009","ordinal":338931,"en":"Wounded in seventy places,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0577:b003:l010","ordinal":338932,"en":"His two mighty arms,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0577:b003:l011","ordinal":338933,"en":"Hung powerless and numb,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0577:b003:l012","ordinal":338934,"en":"His dear head, the lamp of life,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0577:b003:l013","ordinal":338935,"en":"Was bloodied in many places."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0577:b003:l014","ordinal":338936,"en":"The enraged infidel,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0577:b003:l015","ordinal":338937,"en":"The hellish warrior of savage courage,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0577:b003:l016","ordinal":338938,"en":"The fiend no living soul could withstand,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0577:b003:l017","ordinal":338939,"en":"The monster who devoured those beside him,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0577:b003:l018","ordinal":338940,"en":"Would split the ribs"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0577:b003:l019","ordinal":338941,"en":"Of any man who grappled with him."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0577:b003:l020","ordinal":338942,"en":"He had hurled down many,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0577:b003:l021","ordinal":338943,"en":"They called him the wrestler of doom,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0577:b003:l022","ordinal":338944,"en":"And the punishment of those who opposed him,"}]
